                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Buying a <a href=\"/store/inventory?type=trailer&condition=used\">used reefer trailer</a> isn't just a matter of finding a good price. It's about protecting your investment and ensuring you've got equipment you can count on. Whether you're hauling produce across the state or frozen goods across the country, a dependable refrigerated trailer is the backbone of your operation. But with used inventory, not every trailer is built, or maintained, the same. If you're searching for a used reefer trailer for sale, here's what to keep in mind before making your decision.",
