                          "id": "p-step-1",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "The heart of a reefer trailer is the refrigeration system. Before anything else, check that the unit runs reliably and reaches the correct temperature range for your cargo. Look for visible wear, leaks, or damage. Don't be afraid to request a cold test; this verifies how quickly the unit can bring the trailer down to temperature and how well it holds it.",
