                            "text": "Like any vehicle, trailers wear with time. Reefer trailers, in particular, are subject to extra stress, especially from temperature fluctuations and long hauls. A unit that's 10+ years old with high engine hours may be nearing the end of its reliable life. That said, a well-maintained older trailer can still be a smart buy.",
