                        {
                          "id": "p-step-3",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "A used reefer trailer for sale might look good on the outside, but it's the inside that matters most. Damaged insulation, warped walls, or cracked floors can lead to temperature inconsistencies, which could put your loads at risk. Run your hand along the interior for signs of moisture or soft spots. Make sure doors seal tightly and that the gaskets are intact. Proper insulation isn't just about safety; it also helps reduce fuel costs and equipment strain by keeping the cold in longer.",
                            "align": "left",
                            "width": "full"
                          }
                        }
