                    "text": "The Right Trailer for You",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-the-right-trailer-for-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Finding the right used reefer trailer for sale takes more than a quick online search. It takes careful inspection, smart questions, and a dealer who has your back. If you're ready to invest in your next refrigerated trailer, we're here to help you make the right choice, one that keeps your cargo safe, your clients happy, and your wheels turning. Stop by <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a> or reach out to our team; we'll help you find the trailer that's right for your business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-the-right-trailer-for-2",
